# Findstr GPP Passwords | T1552.006 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_findstr_gpp_passwords.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image IN ("*\\find.exe", "*\\findstr.exe") OR OriginalFileName IN ("FIND.EXE", "FINDSTR.EXE")) CommandLine="*cpassword*" CommandLine="*\\sysvol\\*" CommandLine="*.xml*"
